{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicAerosolWaterZSR",
    "description": "MOSAIC's aerosol liquid water content: FUNCTION aerosol_water(jliquid, ibin) of chem/module_mosaic_therm.F (WRF v4.8.0, :16226-16287) with its binary molality FUNCTION bin_molality (:16295-16327), for ONE size bin. Bins are independent here, so a consumer maps this over the bins.\n\nTHE RULE. Zdanovskii-Stokes-Robinson: each soluble electrolyte holds the water its own binary solution would hold at the bin's water activity, so W = sum_e E_e / m_e(a_w), with E_e the electrolyte's liquid-phase amount (nmol per m3 of air) and m_e its binary molality (mol per kg of water). The sum runs over the first NZSR = nsalt + 4 = 19 electrolytes in MOSAIC's order (the 15 salts, H2SO4, MSA, HNO3 and HCl); HHSO4, CaSO4 and CaCO3 hold no water. Since 2014 (RAZ) the non-electrolytes with a hygroscopicity kappa (OC, OIN, BC, SOA) add kappa-Kohler water, kappa V_dry a_w/(1 - a_w). EarthSciModels' sp_ch10/zsr.esm states the same rule for three fixed salts with supplied molalities and is not reused: MOSAIC needs the molality form below over its own 19-electrolyte set, plus the kappa term.\n\nTHE BINARY MOLALITY. MOSAIC fits the solute MOLE FRACTION as a fifth-order polynomial in the water activity, x_e(a) = sum_{p=1..6} A_{p,e} a^{p-1}, and turns it into molality with m = 55.509 x/(1 - x) (55.509 mol of water per kg). Above a_w = 0.97 it switches to the dilute limit m = -B_e ln(a_w). The activity is first held inside the fit's range: a = min(max(a_w, a_min,e), 0.999999).\n\nPRECISION. The thermodynamics runs in real(kind=8), but every literal in these two functions is a DEFAULT-REAL literal (55.509, 0.97, 1.e-9, 1.0e-3), and so are the A, B and a_min tables (load_mosaic_parameters assigns `a_zsr(1,je) = 1.30894`, etc.). Each therefore enters the double-precision arithmetic as its binary32 rounding, which mosaic_thermo_parameters.esm carries; the switch point is the binary32 0.97 = 0.9700000286102295. The 0.999999D0 cap is a genuine double.\n\nA water of exactly zero makes the Fortran reset the bin to all-solid (aerosol_water's error branch); that branch is not transcribed here, and a consumer must treat W = 0 as compute_activities does (it returns before computing any molality).\n\nTESTS AND COVERAGE. Eleven calls from the chem170 compute_activities capture (dumps/chem170_mosaic_therm), against the in-model double-precision water at rel 1e-9; measured 6.2e-15 worst over all 11068 recorded calls. Mutation-checked: dropping the kappa term fails 11 of 11, and so does putting the printed decimal 55.509 or 1e-9 in place of the binary32 value the model computes with. The column never reaches the dilute branch (its bin water activity tops out at 0.77) or the fit-range clamp (a_w >= 0.2 against a_min = 0.1), so 23 hand-specified bins were added on 2026-11-12 (kernels/mosaic_therm_driver (WRF fork earthsciml-instrumented-chem170) runs WRF's own compiled thermodynamics (main/libwrflib.a, the model's flags) on hand-specified bins, cases in data/eqwefic/chem170_scm/therm64/make_cases.py; mode 1 conform_electrolytes, do_full_deliquescence and compute_activities at a stated water activity): water activities 0.05, 0.98 and 0.995, X_T across the regime split, dissolved calcium, sulfate-free, kappa-only and acid bins. Removing the clamp now fails 1 assertion and dropping the dilute branch fails 2. The binary molality and the total are expression templates (mosaic_thermo_templates.esm) because aerosol_phase_state.esm evaluates the same water inside its Kelvin iteration.\n\nCELL AXES (2026-11-12). Every quantity of the bin carries the cell axes [lev, bin] ahead of its own axes (metaparameters NLEV and NBIN, both 1 by default), so a coupling evaluates every size section of every grid cell at once by binding NLEV and NBIN at the mount. The equations are the single-bin ones: an elementwise relation is written on bare names, whose operands esm-spec 4.3.4 aligns by index-set name, and only the reductions and gathers name the cell subscripts k (level) and b (section). The axes are the component's own because pointwise lifting, which would let a single-bin component be mounted per bin, applies to 0-D systems only (esm-spec 10.5).",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Zaveri, R.A., Easter, R.C., Fast, J.D., Peters, L.K. (2008). Model for Simulating Aerosol Interactions and Chemistry (MOSAIC). J. Geophys. Res. 113, D13204."
      },
      {
        "citation": "WRF v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_therm.F"
      }
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1,
      "description": "Grid cells (model levels) evaluated at once; 1 for a single cell. Bound by a column coupling."
    },
    "NBIN": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1,
      "description": "MOSAIC size sections per cell (nbin_a); 1 for a single bin. Bound by the coupling that mounts this component (8 in chem_opt = 170)."
    },
    "NEL": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 22,
      "description": "Number of MOSAIC electrolytes (nelectrolyte)."
    },
    "NZSR": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 19,
      "description": "Electrolytes that hold water, the first nsalt + 4 in MOSAIC's order."
    },
    "NAER": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 112,
      "description": "Number of MOSAIC aerosol species per bin (naer, chem_opt = 170 build)."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "lev": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NLEV"
    },
    "bin": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NBIN"
    },
    "el": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NEL"
    },
    "aer": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NAER"
    },
    "pc": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 6
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "MosaicAerosolWaterZSR": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "./mosaic_thermo_templates.esm"
        }
      ],
      "subsystems": {
        "tp": {
          "ref": "./mosaic_thermo_parameters.esm"
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "a_w": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.8,
          "description": "The bin's water activity ah2o_a(ibin): the ambient relative humidity, lowered by the Kelvin effect where calculate_kelvin has run.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "elec": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Liquid-phase electrolyte amounts electrolyte(je, jliquid, ibin), nmol per m3 of air."
        },
        "aer_t": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "aer"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Total (solid + liquid) species amounts aer(ja, jtotal, ibin), nmol per m3 of air; only the non-electrolytes with kappa > 0 are read."
        },
        "a_fit": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "description": "Water activity held inside each electrolyte's fit range, min(max(a_w, a_min), 0.999999)."
        },
        "x_bin": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "description": "Solute mole fraction of the binary solution from the polynomial fit (used below the 0.97 switch)."
        },
        "m_bin": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "mol/kg",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "description": "Binary molality of each electrolyte at the bin's water activity (bin_molality)."
        },
        "v_kappa": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol*cm^3/(mol*m^3)",
          "description": "kappa-weighted dry volume of the non-electrolytes, sum_a kappa_a A_a mw_a / rho_a (the Fortran's tmpa).",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "water": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "kg/m^3",
          "description": "Aerosol liquid water content of the bin, kg per m3 of air (water_a).",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "a_fit",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b",
              "e"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              },
              "e": {
                "from": "el"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "zsr_fit_activity",
              "bindings": {
                "a": {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "a_w",
                    "k",
                    "b"
                  ]
                },
                "e": "e"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "x_bin",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b",
              "e"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              },
              "e": {
                "from": "el"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "zsr_mole_fraction",
              "bindings": {
                "a": {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "a_fit",
                    "k",
                    "b",
                    "e"
                  ]
                },
                "e": "e"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "m_bin",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b",
              "e"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              },
              "e": {
                "from": "el"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "zsr_binary_molality",
              "bindings": {
                "a": {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "a_w",
                    "k",
                    "b"
                  ]
                },
                "e": "e"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "v_kappa",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "faq",
              "output_idx": [],
              "reduce": "+",
              "args": [],
              "ranges": {
                "a": {
                  "from": "aer"
                }
              },
              "expr": {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": ">",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "index",
                        "args": [
                          "tp.kappa",
                          "a"
                        ]
                      },
                      0.0
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "index",
                                "args": [
                                  "aer_t",
                                  "k",
                                  "b",
                                  "a"
                                ]
                              },
                              {
                                "op": "index",
                                "args": [
                                  "tp.mw_aer",
                                  "a"
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "index",
                            "args": [
                              "tp.dens_aer",
                              "a"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "index",
                        "args": [
                          "tp.kappa",
                          "a"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  0.0
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "water",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "zsr_water",
              "bindings": {
                "a": {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "a_w",
                    "k",
                    "b"
                  ]
                },
                "k": "k",
                "b": "b"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ],
